{"agent_id":"pp3g-jtIK-experiment-7-stage-7c-unit-3-of-6-small-atomic-task","agent_seq":2,"timestamp":"2026-10-02T20:49:04.897148402Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"4ce2b6fe-caab-4f53-9a26-d55b1dcabc0e","comment_uuid":"165076f6-0bf5-420d-804f-4eda0c6a51bc","author":"pp3g-jtIK-experiment-7-stage-7c-unit-3-of-6-small-atomic-task","content":"Plan: 7C-U3 discrimination comparison (Exp7 Noul vs Exp6 Choice), narrow scope.\n\n## Inputs (read-only, exactly five artifacts)\n1. experiment7/DESIGN.md — sections A, E.B, E.C only.\n2. experiment7/PRIMATIVES.md\n3. experiment7/results/exec.jsonl — raw Noul rows (pair_id, variant, ctype, parsed.noul)\n4. experiment6/findings.md — the accepted Exp6 record (quoted, not recomputed)\n\n## Method (deterministic, stdlib only, zero network, zero API)\n- Extract the four readable inputs to a scratch dir in /tmp via 'git show research/jev-phase1-565:<path>' (blob-identical read; the phase2 tree is not in this worktree's checkout).\n- Short python script: parse the raw Noul rows; treat A as the positive class on p_suff; compute AUC by pairwise win-loss-tie counting (AUC = (W + T/2) / (n_pos * n_neg)) over ALL pairs, pooled and per ctype stratum; report to 6 decimal places.\n- Report U-class and A-class per-stratum medians for Exp7 Noul and the range of those per-stratum medians within each class.\n- Quote Exp6 Choice pooled AUC, per-stratum AUCs, and per-stratum class medians + ranges verbatim from experiment6/findings.md, with the file named as the source.\n\n## Output\nresearch/jev-bounded-judgment/phase2/experiment7/stage7/7C-U3-discrimination.md — one file, containing (a) pooled AUC, (b) per-stratum AUCs, (c) quoted Exp6 AUCs, (d) Exp7 per-stratum class medians + within-class ranges, (e) quoted Exp6 medians + ranges, (f) one paragraph (<=5 sentences) on which signal shows the smaller cross-class baseline spread, quoting both numbers.\n\n## Constraints honoured\n- NOT assessed: H1. NOT applied: any threshold to any Noul value.\n- NOT read: experiment6/results/exec.jsonl, experiment7/results/findings.json, experiment7/analyze.py, or any other file under experiment7/stage7/.\n- Stated in the document: Choice is a share among supplied alternatives; Noul is an absolute yes/no probability — the two are not numerically comparable quantities; the comparison is of behaviour, not of level.\n- Commit ONLY that one path on #574.\n\n## Certainty\nPlan is evidence-based (file inventory on research/jev-phase1-565 verified; Exp6 numbers will be quoted, not derived, so no recomputation risk). NOT-TESTED: numerical identity of my AUC implementation against any pre-existing scorer — the formula is stated in the output document so it is independently checkable.","created_at":"2026-10-02T20:49:04.889974324Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:xQ5fstyjT1TTEV9Vw510bo2qPy+9E4pS8fDEarfVQl0","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgv3oF/qo1QFN/mKOtours80Prh8rN5eWdRosaoD96bzYAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAyz0i+w3vS6v8Ori02GFgvaCGypdS/hy0kJYpAZ+k9bziqUJ936Fn+7u6gEUmLKYifinHkNCGfy/R7VLTD+rNBA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:xQ5fstyjT1TTEV9Vw510bo2qPy+9E4pS8fDEarfVQl0","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgv3oF/qo1QFN/mKOtours80Prh8rN5eWdRosaoD96bzYAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPVNgMlLsWP/YZVmhAhfS1YM4McVdx6dpq/gYD3e27PKVWurA75V8hfbczGYXlF8Cgd6kLl3hwmzcdi1FTHhMAU="}
